# Build-context allowlist for the M3f image (ADR-0012). The last matching line decides, and only
# "**" patterns match at any depth. CI verifies the effective context with planted fixtures
# (infra/ci/container_ci.py context).

# 1. Exclude everything.
*

# 2. Include only what the image build needs.
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!alembic.ini
!apps/
!packages/

# 3. Exclude again, at any depth inside the included directories. No exceptions.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.local
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/dist
**/build
**/*.egg-info
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/*.log
